  "id": "social-competence",
  "term": "social competence",
  "definition": "Social competence is the ability to communicate effectively, build healthy relationships, and handle social challenges across development. It includes skills such as cooperation, empathy, and resolving conflicts in ways that support well-being and positive participation with others.",
